OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day with plenty of sunny
OL,6,Fspells and some patchy cloud. Windy
OL,7,Finitially but winds gradually easing
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon. Feeling
OL,9,Fpleasant in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with clear skies at
OL,12,Ffirst, leading to a chilly night.
OL,13,FCloud tending to thicken through the
OL,14,Fevening, with a few outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Fpossible towards dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,18,Fto start Monday. Rain becoming patchy
OL,19,Fand mainly confined to the Pennines
OL,20,Fduring the afternoon, with the best of
OL,21,Fany brightness developing in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
