OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith patchy rain Tuesday. More
OL,7,Fwidespread rain Wednesday, with some
OL,8,Fheavier bursts. Fine and sunny
OL,9,FThursday. Warm by day, but chilly
OL,10,FWednesday and Thursday nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
